      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "DIOGO KEEPING (1) continues to race in super honest form, hitting the frame two times on end before scoring an overdue win last time out (22.41) at this track. Goes very well here finding the frame in each of eight starts. Drawn the rails and rates a key runner. CROCODILE ROLL (7) produced an impressive win last time in quickest of the meeting when scoring by 2.5 lengths (19.67) at Murray Bridge Straight. Looks suited and is one of the contenders. WEBLEC SNIP (5) has been out of the placings last two but shapes well for this if he can recapture his slick win a few runs back, getting around this track over 400m in 22.88. Should be in this for a long way. WITCHER ROSE (3) should be thereabouts.",
